n personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_mTu20Kf1w8Q7kNvwFKrEn-&_nc_oc=AdmMl_z6W8P8SGgM6fbmK-NIdG3A871cDELHyj2CP34mwb71KBda55xs6Ajiw8aoKFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsNtdBxjYVX6KOnxDWPdP7tVEc8mlYXhZGjns0dkKyOJA&oe=699D8901"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9itO1bLHulwQ7kNvwH9zHWj&_nc_oc=Admg1v7QIwnQ9JupRebXC5-YbFNuNswDxixJD3CvpBlzVZ19kTTsbW3OcWKHun6BCaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuOAwZQDp8hg2-iXnNKh6b_aAKraA_hRoYHwenDksYiEQ&oe=699D9666"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yHiCgjgpHdwQ7kNvwHCdFEa&_nc_oc=Adkbd5q2ochCiRjKA7Ui5Tq4Xbp5kAUGtOY0nS5Br31-4sOG3p5l80yuz8d_B8n6TXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuKLdRGmqEc6fJmwbxzKrYyS3qKAL184x0-IB9_w4TEtQ&oe=699DA05C"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_HeroCover_3000x900FRA_v01.png", "id": "1082217212393113", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974873_1082217215726446_517494784553485669_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=80WTKdqO-C8Q7kNvwH7EWmR&_nc_oc=AdlU9sw7Uiqce